The analysis method (trimming, alignment, heterozygous indel detection,
variant calling and HGVS naming) was translated from the Java source code of
SnackVar into Python and modified. The bundled reference sequences in the
"reference" folder are those distributed with SnackVar.

Method publication:
Kim YG, Kim MJ, Lee JS, Lee JA, Song JY, Cho SI, Park SS, Seong MW.
SnackVar: An Open-Source Software for Sanger Sequencing Analysis Optimized
for Clinical Use. J. Mol. Diagn. 2021;23:140-8.
